OL,3,GNEWSA'I sold my home at half its value
OL,4,Adue to Raac'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dundee woman who sold her home at
OL,7,Falmost half of its value because of
OL,8,FRaac said private homeowners must
OL,9,Freceive financial help to repair
OL,10,Faffected properties.
OL,12,FA #21.6m repair scheme for Dundee
OL,13,Fcouncil properties affected by Raac
OL,14,F(reinforced autoclaved aerated
OL,15,Fconcrete) has been approved by
OL,16,Fcouncillors.
OL,18,FHowever, 237 privately-owned properties
OL,19,Fin the affected buildings will have to
OL,20,Fcontribute to the cost of the repair
OL,21,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
